   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK - Department for Work and Pensions</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK Government annual assessed contribution to the International Labour Organisation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UK Government annual assessed contribution to the regular budget of the International Labour Organisation (ILO), 60% of which is classified as ODA.  This applies the OECD DAC coefficient for core contributions to the ILO and represents the proportion of the funds that supports the ILO&apos;s development-related activities. The financial data for the budget and transactions equates to the ODA element: i.e. 60% of each payment made to the ILO</narrative>
  </description>
