   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">ILO Programme &amp; Budget implementation report 2020-21</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">The implementation report provides an overview of activities carried out using member states&apos; core contributions for the calendar years 2020 and 2021, including a results framework of outcomes, and outputs.  This UK&apos;s core contributions (together with those of all other contributing member states) for 2020 and 2021 were used on the activities covered by the report.  Due to the nature of the funding, it is not possible to provide a direct link between UK contributions and specific results achieved</narrative>
   </description>
